@startuml componentes
title Vista de Implementación — Componentes
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Cliente" {
  [SPA Angular 17+]
}

package "API Scala (http4s + Tapir)" {
  [Endpoints REST\n/OpenAPI] as API
  [Auth Adapter\nJWKS Supabase] as Auth
  [Casos de Uso\n(application)] as UC
  [Dominio\n(reglas puras)] as Domain
  [Repositorios\n(Skunk)] as Repo
  [Auditoría] as Audit
  [Notificaciones] as Notify
  [Reportería\nJasperReports] as Report
}

package "Supabase" {
  database "PostgreSQL 15+\nRLS" as DB
  [Supabase Auth\n(GoTrue)] as GoTrue
  [Storage] as Storage
}

[Metabase] as Meta
[JasperReports Server] as Jasper

SPA --> API : HTTPS/JSON + JWT
API --> Auth
API --> UC
UC --> Domain
UC --> Repo
UC --> Audit
UC --> Notify
Repo --> DB
Auth --> GoTrue
SPA --> GoTrue : login/refresh
Repo --> DB : SQL transaccional
Report --> Jasper : plantillas .jrxml
UC --> Report
Meta --> DB : solo lectura
SPA --> Storage : archivos

note right of API
  Contrato único generado desde Tapir:
  OpenAPI 3.1 + Swagger UI
end note

note bottom of Domain
  Sin dependencias de HTTP ni SQL:
  testeable de forma pura (Cats)
end note

@enduml
